WEBVTT

00:10.510 --> 00:12.846
- Havin' a Broseph? Can I join ya?
- Dad, can you not?

00:12.929 --> 00:13.972
Aww.

00:14.764 --> 00:17.142
Tell me about life in your nomad clan.

00:17.225 --> 00:18.476
My clan, huh?

00:18.560 --> 00:21.312
- We're a small part of Snake Nation.
- Hmm?

00:21.396 --> 00:24.733
Honest folk, most of 'em.
Same was true of my clan.

00:24.816 --> 00:26.818
A few Vipers hated my guts,

00:26.901 --> 00:29.070
but the head of the family
always had my back.

00:29.654 --> 00:32.407
- Did you have friends?
- Lots of 'em, yeah.

00:32.490 --> 00:37.454
Kenzo, José, Renée, Omi, and Marvette.

00:37.996 --> 00:40.457
Oh, and how can I forget Renji?

00:40.540 --> 00:44.044
You remind me of him.
He was about your age.

00:50.341 --> 00:52.010
I still dream of them.

00:52.093 --> 00:53.053
You do?

00:53.136 --> 00:54.846
Every night, when the stars come out,

00:55.555 --> 00:56.473
they find me.

01:44.187 --> 01:46.940
10:15 on a Saturday night

01:48.399 --> 01:52.904
And the tap drips under the striplight

01:55.365 --> 01:57.951
And I'm sitting in the kitchen sink

02:00.954 --> 02:03.456
And the tap drips
Drip, drip, drip, drip

02:03.540 --> 02:05.750
Drip, drip, drip, drip, drip, drip

02:31.025 --> 02:32.360
We got a visitor.

02:32.443 --> 02:33.778
Damn it!

02:33.862 --> 02:35.196
Well? Who is he?

02:35.280 --> 02:37.073
- Fuck if I know.
- Do you?

02:37.157 --> 02:38.908
- Hm?
- Don't look at me.

02:38.992 --> 02:40.118
Yo, rust bucket.

02:40.201 --> 02:42.078
- Oh!
- Fuck you doin' on our turf?

02:42.162 --> 02:43.830
- Got a tongue, so wag it.
- Huh?

02:43.913 --> 02:46.291
Hey, Talia, you know this choom?

02:46.374 --> 02:48.835
- You deaf, old-timer?
- Huh.

02:48.918 --> 02:51.504
Promised us no more interruptions.

02:51.588 --> 02:53.464
Or did I mis-fuckin'-hear?

02:53.548 --> 02:55.466
He's no one I know.

02:55.550 --> 02:56.467
Talia!

02:56.551 --> 02:59.095
That's enough outta you.

03:00.555 --> 03:02.515
You done?

03:02.599 --> 03:04.601
Shit.

03:08.062 --> 03:09.480
No.

03:09.564 --> 03:10.982
Not done yet.

03:11.065 --> 03:13.985
Runnin' on bargain-bin chrome.

03:14.068 --> 03:16.404
What do you think
you're gonna pull here, huh?

03:16.487 --> 03:17.864
Tough old bastard, give ya that--

03:17.947 --> 03:19.616
Fuck! Look out!

03:21.784 --> 03:23.244
Oops.

03:23.786 --> 03:26.664
Oops is right, you yappy sack of shit!

03:30.501 --> 03:32.337
- Scan him.
- On it.

03:32.420 --> 03:35.006
Ran your damn mouth again. Got distracted.

03:35.089 --> 03:36.758
Well, the gonk's, like, super weak.

03:36.841 --> 03:39.177
Which don't matter if he's packin' iron!

03:39.260 --> 03:41.179
Damn it. T-Talia.

03:41.262 --> 03:42.472
And you!

03:42.555 --> 03:46.643
What's a guy with paperclips for arms
doin' with a hand cannon like that?

03:46.726 --> 03:49.437
Talia! Wanna tell us why this bum's here?

03:49.520 --> 03:50.688
Huh?

03:52.440 --> 03:53.316
Yo, yo!

03:53.399 --> 03:55.944
- Choom reads like a cyberpsycho burnout.
- What?

03:56.027 --> 03:57.779
- You're shittin' me.
- Huh?

03:57.862 --> 04:00.823
You used to be
an edgerunner, old man?

04:00.907 --> 04:02.325
Well, shit.

04:02.408 --> 04:04.410
Grab him. Pin him down!

04:04.494 --> 04:08.081
Hey! What the hell? Get your hands off me!

04:08.164 --> 04:10.583
Relax. Routine maintenance.

04:11.167 --> 04:14.587
We'll give ya a jump-start. Bring
that old chrome of yours back to life.

04:15.171 --> 04:18.341
To witness the moment
a cyberpsycho is born...

04:18.424 --> 04:20.927
Ain't nothin' in this world
more beautiful!

04:24.847 --> 04:27.100
Hey, what about me?

04:27.600 --> 04:30.395
Yeah, what about you? Yo, hold him down!

04:30.478 --> 04:32.438
Today's my day on the table.

04:32.522 --> 04:33.731
You said so.

04:34.232 --> 04:35.441
Hey!

04:39.153 --> 04:41.572
- Entitled little bitch.
- Huh?

04:41.656 --> 04:43.408
I said we're tired of your shit!

04:43.491 --> 04:45.702
Today, it's this fucking clown!

04:45.785 --> 04:50.164
And before that, a whole goddamn corp army
kicked down our door 'cause of you!

04:50.748 --> 04:52.292
And you ran away.

04:53.084 --> 04:56.087
- What?
- Ran from Kang Tao like cowards!

04:56.170 --> 04:57.797
The fuck did you just say?

04:57.880 --> 05:00.300
But not me!

05:02.885 --> 05:07.807
I ain't takin' no more shit
from a trust-fund brat!

05:14.105 --> 05:16.024
Just blast her already!

05:16.107 --> 05:18.484
Shut up. Don't got a clear shot.

05:18.568 --> 05:20.945
Yo, what do you want me
to do with this guy?

05:28.578 --> 05:29.787
Yaah!

05:34.459 --> 05:37.545
Now die, poser bitch!

05:40.298 --> 05:41.799
Don't move!

05:42.300 --> 05:44.135
See? Aim's still sharp.

05:44.218 --> 05:45.845
Willin' to risk it?

05:45.928 --> 05:49.474
You wanna live?
Then step away from the girl!

05:51.726 --> 05:52.977
Now!

05:56.564 --> 05:59.317
Talia, knock it off! They're leavin'!

05:59.400 --> 06:00.943
She's fuckin' whacked!

06:02.528 --> 06:04.364
You're a whacking bunch of traitors!

06:04.447 --> 06:06.824
- Calm down.
- You're safe now.

06:06.908 --> 06:08.076
Talia!

06:09.702 --> 06:14.082
Safe? That's what you think?
That you saved me?

06:14.165 --> 06:15.875
This was your fault!

06:15.958 --> 06:17.627
Doesn't matter now.

06:17.710 --> 06:19.879
It's over. Stand down.

06:19.962 --> 06:21.923
Taking you back to your mom.

06:22.006 --> 06:25.676
What the fuck?

06:25.760 --> 06:27.136
Talia?

06:30.556 --> 06:34.143
It's... it's always the same
with you people.

06:34.227 --> 06:38.356
Is taking everything from me
so fucking fun for you?

06:38.439 --> 06:41.526
I have nothing left. Nothing!

06:41.609 --> 06:44.737
- Hey, you all right?
- Don't touch me!

06:49.283 --> 06:50.535
Talia? Talia!

06:54.831 --> 06:55.790
The chip?

06:56.290 --> 06:57.834
Lost, I'm afraid.

06:58.751 --> 07:01.546
My rivals are pressing me
for accountability.

07:01.629 --> 07:04.215
In acquiring the chip,
we would have silenced them.

07:04.298 --> 07:05.550
Now, they'll grow louder.

07:06.134 --> 07:07.343
Bolder.

07:07.427 --> 07:10.263
In hindsight, we should have
arranged for a backup plan.

07:10.346 --> 07:12.432
I didn't expect our outsource would fail.

07:12.515 --> 07:14.225
We gave them good intel.

07:15.059 --> 07:17.603
That was the risk of hiring mercenaries.

07:18.312 --> 07:21.023
All because I took my wife's advice.

07:21.107 --> 07:22.567
Funny, isn't it?

07:23.651 --> 07:24.986
No, sir.

07:25.069 --> 07:27.280
It's all right. You're free to laugh.

07:27.780 --> 07:30.992
It seems the crew's leader
is an old flame of hers.

07:31.784 --> 07:34.328
I hear he was discharged
from the hospital.

07:35.121 --> 07:38.833
More importantly, the chip.
What have you learned?

07:38.916 --> 07:43.087
We don't believe that MaxTac has it.
Or the NCPD broadly.

07:43.171 --> 07:46.340
Likewise, there's no indication
of internal misappropriation.

07:46.424 --> 07:49.135
And we've confirmed
Arasaka didn't recover it?

07:49.218 --> 07:50.595
That's correct.

07:50.678 --> 07:54.432
The most plausible scenario is
acquisition by an unknown third party.

07:55.475 --> 07:58.853
Meaning they would've arrived
prior to the police.

08:03.941 --> 08:05.735
An extraction like that requires

08:05.818 --> 08:08.446
the precision and timing
of a professional.

08:08.946 --> 08:10.323
Question's who.

08:11.324 --> 08:12.575
They all look the same!

08:12.658 --> 08:15.369
- Someone's coming. Kyoko...
- Chill, Miggy. Finish my...

08:15.453 --> 08:18.122
They're taking me! Someone's--

08:18.206 --> 08:19.123
Kyoko!

08:21.167 --> 08:22.251
Capri?

08:25.338 --> 08:27.256
Weird dream.

08:27.924 --> 08:29.634
Huh. Huh?

08:30.134 --> 08:31.761
Why is surveillance offline?

08:33.846 --> 08:35.014
The fuck?

08:35.890 --> 08:38.518
Huh? That case, is that Capri?

08:38.601 --> 08:42.230
Dickheads! I told 'em to push
the goddamn security update.

08:43.272 --> 08:44.857
- Got ya!
- Our ride?

08:44.941 --> 08:47.401
- Front porch.
- Stupid security!

08:47.485 --> 08:48.945
- Idiots! Idiots!
- Wheelman?

08:49.028 --> 08:51.906
Sorry, some items may be sold separately.

08:51.989 --> 08:53.115
Right. Hold on.

08:53.199 --> 08:55.493
- Suck it!
- Shit! Fall ba--

08:55.576 --> 08:57.411
King! Run a scan!

08:57.495 --> 08:59.038
Miguel!

09:09.298 --> 09:12.009
Shit! Shit! They're getting away!

09:13.052 --> 09:15.513
Die, jizzbags! Die!

09:17.056 --> 09:19.725
Jackpot! Never a chance!

09:19.809 --> 09:21.477
Aah!

09:22.270 --> 09:25.022
- Miguel, the case.
- Leave the fucking thing.

09:25.106 --> 09:26.232
We need to bail.

09:30.319 --> 09:32.655
Hey, snap out of it! You from the lab?

09:32.738 --> 09:34.407
Call MaxTac!

09:34.490 --> 09:36.242
- Confirmed cyberpsycho!
- Get back!

09:44.625 --> 09:47.420
I did it! I got you out. Capri!

09:47.503 --> 09:49.088
I'm here!

09:49.547 --> 09:51.591
You're free of Arasaka's shackles.

09:51.674 --> 09:53.467
Free to exist.

09:53.551 --> 09:55.052
And you're all mine!

09:55.136 --> 09:57.388
You're always and forever mine!

10:05.771 --> 10:08.274
Fuck you! Rotten shits!

10:08.357 --> 10:10.401
Calling Capri worthless? Then die!

10:10.484 --> 10:12.903
She'll grind your motherfucking tongues!

10:12.987 --> 10:15.031
Serves you right! She belongs to me!

10:15.114 --> 10:16.532
Capri is mine!

10:16.616 --> 10:18.784
Mine! Mine!

10:18.868 --> 10:21.829
Oh, good, good, good. You came back.

10:21.912 --> 10:23.789
Your little shadow, too.

10:24.624 --> 10:26.542
Are you our lucky ticket?

10:26.626 --> 10:29.045
I have high hopes for you, boy.

10:30.588 --> 10:32.131
So, how we gettin' in?

10:33.007 --> 10:33.966
Hmm?

10:34.050 --> 10:35.217
D?

10:35.926 --> 10:37.553
Going through the same door.

10:37.637 --> 10:39.305
Got a score to settle.

11:14.423 --> 11:16.342
This was your brilliant plan?

11:16.425 --> 11:20.096
Running us in circles, round
and around and around this dump?

11:21.514 --> 11:23.224
I'm gonna die in here,

11:23.307 --> 11:25.768
thanks to you and your stupid
revenge trip, you moron!

11:30.022 --> 11:31.232
Huh?

11:31.315 --> 11:33.651
Wait! Don't leave me behind!

11:33.734 --> 11:35.486
Suddenly, he knows where to go?

11:36.070 --> 11:37.530
How?

11:42.201 --> 11:43.619
D, wait!

11:55.256 --> 11:56.257
Huh?

11:57.508 --> 11:59.927
- What is that?
- Rot.

12:00.010 --> 12:01.262
You mean...

12:01.846 --> 12:03.848
The smell of meat gone bad.

12:05.599 --> 12:07.518
Uh...

12:09.603 --> 12:12.690
What? You've never seen a corpse?

12:13.357 --> 12:14.608
Not this many.

12:19.363 --> 12:21.282
He doesn't look dead.

12:21.365 --> 12:23.284
Still hangin' on, this one.

12:25.453 --> 12:26.537
Hmm?

12:26.620 --> 12:29.123
Is that a chip?

12:35.671 --> 12:36.839
Found you.

12:37.673 --> 12:38.549
Huh?

12:39.133 --> 12:40.050
Wha...

13:07.077 --> 13:08.329
Huh?

13:18.172 --> 13:19.882
Uh... D?

13:22.635 --> 13:24.053
Is that a kid?

13:26.055 --> 13:27.973
Success!

13:31.018 --> 13:33.479
He's alive! He's alive! He lives!

13:34.563 --> 13:35.898
Uh... Huh?

13:46.659 --> 13:47.660
D?

13:51.080 --> 13:53.499
No! Why'd the door unlock?

13:54.583 --> 13:57.002
Hey, wait! Where you goin'?

13:57.586 --> 13:58.420
Fuck!

13:58.504 --> 14:01.423
Fuck, fuck, fuck, fuck, fuck, fuck, fuck!

14:01.507 --> 14:05.177
Capri! Stop! Don't run from me too!

14:05.261 --> 14:07.054
You're not going anywhere!

14:10.349 --> 14:11.892
Whew. There you are!

14:11.976 --> 14:13.227
Wait for me.

14:16.564 --> 14:18.274
- So clingy.
- D?

14:18.357 --> 14:19.608
Wait!

14:38.836 --> 14:40.546
- Hey.
- Huh?

14:40.629 --> 14:42.548
Give me back my damn body.

14:43.215 --> 14:44.675
Wow.

14:44.758 --> 14:45.593
Go away.

14:47.678 --> 14:49.471
I'm surprised to see you still here.

14:49.555 --> 14:50.973
It's my body!

14:55.644 --> 14:57.229
Huh?

14:59.315 --> 15:00.983
C'mere! [grunts[

15:01.984 --> 15:03.736
Bye-bye, choomba!

15:09.491 --> 15:10.910
D?

15:12.328 --> 15:15.372
Whoa! This takes me back!

15:23.213 --> 15:24.924
Yuck!

15:25.007 --> 15:26.884
Stop doin' weird shit with my body!

15:26.967 --> 15:29.386
Oh, wow! It's you again, huh?

15:29.470 --> 15:31.096
You're strange and feisty!

15:31.180 --> 15:33.265
You shoulda already
fizzled and popped by now.

15:33.349 --> 15:35.392
Who's callin' who strange?

15:35.476 --> 15:37.895
Oh, wait! What are you doin'?
What are you doin'?

15:37.978 --> 15:40.397
Wait... Whoa! Wait!

15:40.481 --> 15:43.359
Whoa! No, no, no, no, no, no, no!

15:44.985 --> 15:46.570
What? No way!

15:46.654 --> 15:50.282
Wh... what did you do to me?
This is amazing!

15:50.366 --> 15:53.285
You full of any more fun surprises?

15:56.789 --> 15:57.915
Hey-oh!

16:06.131 --> 16:08.133
Whoa...

16:10.594 --> 16:11.929
Did you do that?

16:12.012 --> 16:14.264
Sure did! And now it's your turn.

16:14.348 --> 16:15.808
Huh?

16:18.143 --> 16:19.979
Oh shit! Gah!

16:21.772 --> 16:24.066
Whoa! Whoa...

16:26.443 --> 16:28.821
Dumbass! Why don't ya watch the damn road?

16:28.904 --> 16:30.030
You're blamin' me?

16:30.114 --> 16:33.617
You didn't see that big red flash?
The steering wheel short-circed!

16:33.701 --> 16:36.787
It was that guy!
That spiky-haired dickwad hacked my ride!

16:36.870 --> 16:38.831
It never is your fault, is it?

16:38.914 --> 16:40.666
Woman, are you blind?

16:40.749 --> 16:42.251
- Not like you!
- Are too!

16:42.334 --> 16:43.919
- A little help?
- Are too!

16:44.003 --> 16:46.380
- My seatbelt's jammed! Hello?
- Fuck you!

16:46.463 --> 16:48.007
- Oh, shut up!
- Somebody--

16:48.090 --> 16:50.134
Why are you so fuckin' trigger happy?

16:50.217 --> 16:52.386
I'm gonna get that spiky-haired freak!

16:52.469 --> 16:55.889
I knew you could do it!

16:55.973 --> 16:57.433
What the hell are you talking about?

16:57.516 --> 16:59.393
You've been pulling my strings
this whole time!

16:59.476 --> 17:01.437
Huh? Uh-uh! That was all you!

17:01.520 --> 17:03.981
Get your digi ass down here, demon bitch!

17:04.064 --> 17:06.650
Uh-oh! I'm gonna have
to yank you for a sec.

17:06.734 --> 17:08.402
Huh?

17:08.485 --> 17:09.653
D!

17:09.737 --> 17:11.155
Roman?

17:13.574 --> 17:16.118
The fuck's your problem, freak?

17:16.201 --> 17:17.745
Yikes. She's mad at you.

17:17.828 --> 17:20.205
- I'll let you handle the missus.
- Huh?

17:20.289 --> 17:21.749
Go on! Don't be shy.

17:21.832 --> 17:24.752
You were almost a puddle of goo
on their windshield.

17:24.835 --> 17:26.253
That wasn't me who crashed 'em.

17:26.336 --> 17:27.880
That was all you, boo.

17:27.963 --> 17:29.465
You're dead!

17:39.933 --> 17:40.851
Coward!

17:40.934 --> 17:43.062
Gonna regret this, asshole!

17:47.858 --> 17:50.069
Yay, you did it!

17:50.152 --> 17:53.572
You're really, really good!
C'mon, let's play!

17:54.156 --> 17:55.324
Play what?

17:55.407 --> 17:56.909
You'll like this game.

18:00.913 --> 18:02.915
Huh? Wha...

18:16.678 --> 18:17.930
Huh?

18:18.430 --> 18:19.807
Mm-hm.

18:33.195 --> 18:34.863
Is this D?

18:34.947 --> 18:36.949
Causing this mess?

18:38.700 --> 18:40.119
And he's laughing?

18:44.206 --> 18:45.415
Hmm.

18:45.916 --> 18:48.001
Huh?

18:48.085 --> 18:49.962
Our baddies brought back more baddies.

18:50.045 --> 18:52.965
There he is! Dipshit must
want us to beat his ass!

18:53.048 --> 18:55.467
Yeah! Yeah! Fuck him up!

18:56.051 --> 18:56.969
D!

18:57.052 --> 18:59.179
I think I'm startin' to have fun.

18:59.263 --> 19:00.472
Gonna crash 'em?

19:00.556 --> 19:02.558
That tired stunt? Again?

19:03.308 --> 19:05.686
I'd be in a real jam if you splatted now.

19:05.769 --> 19:08.021
So? Where's the thrill?

19:08.105 --> 19:10.607
You've gotta be more creative than that.

19:10.691 --> 19:12.067
More creative?

19:12.568 --> 19:15.112
That's right. Show 'em a good time.

19:15.195 --> 19:17.406
Had so much fun, they came back for more.

19:17.489 --> 19:20.492
Let's give these statics
a spectacle they'll never forget.

19:23.704 --> 19:25.247
Hmm?

19:25.831 --> 19:27.082
- You're awake?
- Mmph.

19:28.333 --> 19:31.545
I just talked to your mom.
She's on her way now.

19:32.254 --> 19:34.631
- What?
- You passed out. Collapsed.

19:34.715 --> 19:36.383
- I brought you here.
- Oh...

19:36.884 --> 19:38.886
Whoa, take it easy.

19:42.973 --> 19:45.142
Where... where am I?

19:45.225 --> 19:47.853
Ripperdoc clinic.
Belongs to a friend of mine.

19:47.936 --> 19:49.396
Just stepped out.

19:49.479 --> 19:52.858
I know it's not Med Center,
but this doc's no hack.

19:52.941 --> 19:55.402
You're in good hands here.

19:56.570 --> 19:57.779
I'm leavin'.

19:57.863 --> 20:00.532
Just sit tight. Your mom'll be here soon.

20:00.616 --> 20:04.036
I'm not going anywhere with her.

20:04.703 --> 20:07.289
Said take it easy. Need a hand?

20:19.384 --> 20:21.595
Watch this!

20:26.892 --> 20:27.851
Don't touch me!

20:43.617 --> 20:46.036
Quit acting like you did me a favor!

20:46.119 --> 20:48.038
You...

20:48.622 --> 20:50.249
How can you live like that?

20:50.874 --> 20:52.918
Shedding off your chrome in fear?

20:53.001 --> 20:54.294
I would never!

20:55.712 --> 20:56.922
Talia.

20:57.005 --> 20:59.174
Don't act like you know me!

20:59.716 --> 21:02.344
I'm not anything like you!

21:02.844 --> 21:04.054
Not at all...

21:11.019 --> 21:12.938
Huh? The lights...

21:20.070 --> 21:21.947
Talia. Wait.

21:28.870 --> 21:30.038
Oh.

21:32.416 --> 21:33.709
Ohh...

21:35.752 --> 21:37.587
Oh God! Talia!

21:37.671 --> 21:40.340
Are you hurt? Are you okay, baby?

21:40.841 --> 21:42.968
All clear here. Check around back.

21:43.051 --> 21:45.095
Hey, uh, maybe give her some air.

21:45.178 --> 21:47.597
How did this happen,
with you keepin' an eye on her?

21:47.681 --> 21:49.850
Oh! Sorry, baby.

21:49.933 --> 21:50.934
Uh...

21:52.060 --> 21:54.521
Avida. We should talk.

21:55.314 --> 21:56.440
All right.

21:59.151 --> 22:00.861
About Talia...

22:01.778 --> 22:02.821
What is it?

22:02.904 --> 22:05.866
She had a seizure. It knocked her out.

22:05.949 --> 22:09.494
Given what I saw,
and what the ripper's tests told us,.

22:09.578 --> 22:11.830
cyberpsychosis seems a possibility.

22:11.913 --> 22:13.832
But just early signs.

22:13.915 --> 22:15.792
See? It's just like I was telling you.

22:15.876 --> 22:17.753
If she downgrades her cyberware,

22:17.836 --> 22:20.630
stays on immunoblockers,
she'll be all right.

22:20.714 --> 22:22.257
- You're sure?
- Yeah.

22:22.758 --> 22:24.718
Assuming she cooperates.

22:26.470 --> 22:28.597
But there's somethin' I can't figure out.

22:29.097 --> 22:30.140
What's that?

22:30.891 --> 22:32.893
I think I misread the situation.

22:33.393 --> 22:34.603
Way I see it,

22:35.312 --> 22:38.440
Talia's not sold on
Maelstrom's cult ideology.

22:38.940 --> 22:40.400
She's not one of 'em.

22:40.484 --> 22:42.569
- So why this obsession with chrome?
- Mmph!

22:42.652 --> 22:43.737
Do you know?

22:43.820 --> 22:45.322
There's gotta be some reason for it.

22:45.405 --> 22:47.407
Right?

22:48.075 --> 22:49.326
Thought so.

22:54.748 --> 22:57.125
Talia! I didn't know if you...

22:57.209 --> 22:59.461
I mean... I'm sorry about today.

22:59.544 --> 23:01.254
Something important came up.

23:01.963 --> 23:03.423
You... you still mad?

23:03.507 --> 23:05.133
Obviously.

23:05.217 --> 23:08.178
Right. But I guess your surgery went well?

23:09.971 --> 23:11.264
Did it... not?

23:39.960 --> 23:42.170
Ew, that kid's forehead!

23:42.254 --> 23:43.338
Huh?

23:43.922 --> 23:44.840
Hm?

23:47.884 --> 23:49.094
Oh.

23:49.177 --> 23:50.595
I'm bleeding.

23:54.182 --> 23:55.517
Hmm.

23:56.435 --> 23:57.602
Hmm.

24:07.195 --> 24:08.905
Did ya have some fun?

24:08.989 --> 24:09.865
Uh-huh.

24:10.615 --> 24:12.200
Good boy!

24:20.125 --> 24:21.001
Huh?

24:23.920 --> 24:25.422
Why can't we move?

24:26.006 --> 24:27.507
This thing on?

24:29.426 --> 24:30.510
That's not good.

24:31.011 --> 24:32.554
I'm stuck.

24:41.229 --> 24:42.355
Huh?

25:03.043 --> 25:06.171
Didn't mean to sound arrogant

25:06.254 --> 25:10.634
Suddenly we don't feel the same

25:10.717 --> 25:13.386
All I needed was to get it straight

25:13.470 --> 25:17.766
How I feel isn't complicated

25:17.849 --> 25:20.519
Everything that I long to be

25:20.602 --> 25:22.187
You and me

25:22.270 --> 25:24.814
There's more than meets the eye

25:24.898 --> 25:27.776
Everything that I long to be

25:27.859 --> 25:31.530
As in you and

25:31.613 --> 25:38.578
I'm wandering on the city harbour

25:38.662 --> 25:43.416
Now possibly I will see you

25:43.500 --> 25:45.627
In Watson

25:45.710 --> 25:48.338
Run away with me

25:48.421 --> 25:52.759
You're my West Coast problem

25:52.842 --> 25:55.303
Now, finally

25:55.387 --> 25:59.849
We are goin' home

25:59.933 --> 26:04.187
Once again, I lose it all

26:04.271 --> 26:06.898
Once again, I lose it

26:06.982 --> 26:10.443
Once again, I lose it

26:10.527 --> 26:15.490
Once again, I lose it all

26:15.574 --> 26:18.034
Begging for this love

26:18.118 --> 26:23.373
Once again, I lose it all
